  "decision": "Preserve these claims as focused research gaps. Do not create Catholic Life 2.0 and do not surface unsourced pastoral synthesis until it has explicit authority.",
  "publication_gate": [
    "Every user-facing explanatory/pastoral claim must acquire an explicit source or be rewritten as clearly identified app guidance with a documented basis.",
    "Funeral/Requiem should preferentially converge with the Serious Illness/after-death and certified Requiem owners, not become a duplicate death module.",
